lve a novel contemporary biomedical problem in areas including biomaterials engineering, tissue engineering, biomechanics, biomedical robotics, drug delivery, biomolecule detection, and other emerging areas. The Ph.D. program combines fundamental and elective coursework with an intensive research experience. Some doctoral students pursue internships at private companies, startups or other academic laboratories during the course of their studies. A detailed coursework plan and application portal can be found at Rowan Global.\nHenry M. Rowan College of Engineering\nBack to Biomedical Engineering (BME)\nMain Menu\nBiomedical Engineering (BME)\nMessage From The Chair\nAbout Us\nContacts\nCampus Map & Directions\nAccreditation\nFaculty & Staff\nUndergraduate Programs\nB.S. in BME\nCurriculum\nAccelerated Programs\nDegree Program Enrichments\nCertificates of Undergraduate Study\nGraduate Program\nM.S. Program\nPh.D. Program\nMaster of Translational Orthopedic Device Engineering\nMD/Ph.D. Program\nDO/Ph.D. Program\nEngineering Clinics\nResearch\nProspective Students\nOutreach\nBEAM\nRISER\nNews\nBME News\nStudent Spotlight\nRowan on LinkedIn\nRowan on Facebook\nRowan on Instagram\nRowan on YouTube\nRowan on Tiktok\nRowan University \u2022 201 Mullica Hill Road \u2022 Glassboro, New Jersey 08028 \u2022 856-256-4000\n\u00a92026 Rowan University. Consumer Disclosures | Legal Notices | University Catalog\nRead the Notice of Availability of Rowan\u2019s Annual Security & Fire Safety Report", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://engineering.rowan.edu/programs/biomedical/graduate_programs/phdbme.html#main"], ["News", "https://today.rowan.edu/index.html"], ["Alumni", "https://www.alumni.rowan.edu/s/1653/02-alumni/start.aspx?gid=2&pgid=61"], ["Parents", "https://sites.rowan.edu/parentsfamily/index.html"], ["Donors", "https://sites.rowan.edu/advancement/index.html"], ["Jobs", "https://jobs.rowan.edu/en-us/listing/"], ["Apply", "https://admissions.rowan.edu/admissions-process/